        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "A single rendered message sent to one recipient.\n\nKeyed on `id`. `metrics` accretes engagement timestamps for days to weeks\nafter `created` is fixed, and no field is filterable by that update time, so\nthe stream pairs an incremental pass with a trailing re-scan.",
